  "question": {
    "text": "Which one of the following equations does not correctly represent the first law of thermodynamics for the given processes involving an ideal gas? (Assume non- expansion work is zero)"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "Isochoric process : <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></math>",
