  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "For cyclic process: <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></math>  <br/>For isothermal process: <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></math>  <br/>For adiabatic process: <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></math>  <br/>For isochoric process: <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></math>"
